    "pdpPlainTextPreview": "Issued to mark the historic Platinum Jubilee of Queen Elizabeth II\nWE ARE STRENGTHENING ACCOUNT SECURITY AND PROTECTING YOUR ACCESS WITH 2 STEP VERIFICATION. FIND OUT MORE Home Sovereign All Sovereign Coins 2022 Elizabeth II Gold Proof £5 (Quintuple) Sovereign Share via Gold Proof 2022 Elizabeth II Gold Proof £5 (Quintuple) Sovereign Graded as PF70 Ultra Cameo Price: £3,750.00 EMAIL ME WHEN IN STOCK Email Me When In Stock PRODUCT CODE: HIS225UC Struck by The Royal Mint to the highest proof standard in 22-carat gold Independently graded a perfect PF70 Ultra Cameo, indicating flawless condition Issued to mark the historic Platinum Jubilee of Queen Elizabeth II Features an exclusive one-year-only reverse design by Timothy Noad Depicts a heraldic Royal Arms motif, replacing the traditional St George and the dragon Official obverse bears the fifth and final effigy of Her Majesty by Jody Clark Initially released exclusively as part of a five-coin set with a strictly limited mintage Gold Proof Read the full description YOU MIGHT ALSO BE INTERESTED IN ADD TO BASKET Britannia 2026 1oz Silver Bullion Coin £62.52 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Britannia 2022 1 oz Silver Bullion Coin £61.32 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Level 5 Genius Medal £9.95 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Britannia 2026 1oz Gold Bullion Coin £3,487.00 In Stock ADD TO BASKET 100th Anniversary of the Birth of Queen Elizabeth II 2026 UK £5 Brilliant Uncirculated Coin £17.50 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Britannia 2026 1oz Silver Bullion Twenty-Five Coin Tube £1,483.00 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Level 4 Mastermind Medal £9.95 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Britannia 1g Gold Bullion Minted Bar £140.78 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Level 3 Decoder Medal £9.95 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Level 2 Explorer Medal and Collector Folder £9.95 In Stock Celebrate a historic royal milestone with the 2022 Elizabeth II Gold Proof £5 (Quintuple) Sovereign, graded a flawless PF70 Ultra Cameo by NGC. Struck by The Royal Mint in 22-carat gold, this Quintuple Sovereign contains 39.94 grams of gold and measures 36.02 mm in diameter, making it the largest coin in the prestigious Sovereign family. This special edition was issued to commemorate the Platinum Jubilee of Queen Elizabeth II—the first British monarch to reach 70 years on the throne. Instead of the traditional St George and the dragon, the reverse features a unique one-off heraldic arms design by Timothy Noad. This striking image brings together the Lion of England and the Unicorn of Scotland, supporting a crowned shield —a tribute to the Queen’s remarkable reign. The obverse displays Jody Clark’s highly regarded effigy of the late Queen. Only 700 sets including the Quintuple Sovereign were released, marking it as a true rarity for collectors and a noteworthy departure from the familiar Sovereign design. The proof striking delivers mirror-like fields and ultra-frosted devices, and the PF70 Ultra Cameo grade ensures this coin is without equal in terms of quality and finish. Collectors will appreciate not only the coin’s exceptional condition and exacting detail but also its historical significance as a lasting tribute to the final chapter of Queen Elizabeth II's legendary legacy. *Image is representative of the coin you will receive. SPECIFICATION Specification Value Denomination Sovereign Alloy 22 Carat Gold Weight 39.94 g Diameter 36.02mm Reverse Designer Timothy Noad Specification Value Obverse Designer Jody Clark Quality Proof Year 2022 Pure Metal Type Gold"
